# Data
# The Cookie Cats dataset is small and committed so the analysis is reproducible.
# Uncomment the next line if the dataset should be fetched rather than tracked.
# data/*.csv

# Power BI
# The .pbix is deliberately NOT ignored: this is a portfolio repo, and being able
# to download and open the dashboard is the point. It is a binary blob that git
# cannot diff, so each save adds its full size to history - if that becomes a
# problem, uncomment the line below and commit the .pbip project folders instead.
# *.pbix

# Power BI working files and caches (never useful to commit)
*.pbix.tmp
temp.pbix
.pbi/
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf
